# "Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library, then draws seven cards. You untap up to six lands." The spent Black Lotus (graveyard) and Bot1's hand go back into its library and Bot2's discards into its own: both graveyards are
# empty afterwards, both hands hold seven cards, Bot1's library holds the 12 other cards and Bot2's 13. "Up to": Bot1 untaps only one of its two Islands; the tapped Sol Ring is not a land and stays tapped.

